{"id": "DdZPRfiStXv", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"SEO\" to get these 3 Claude Code plugins to boost your SEO. \n\nYou don't need to pay for expensive SEO tools anymore.\n\nInstead use these 3 free plugins to turn your Claude Code into an SEO expert instantly.\n\nFirst is GSC MCP.\n\nIt connects Claude directly to your Google Search Console.\n\nIt studies your analytics and finds the keywords you are close to ranking for.\n\nThen it tells you exactly what to fix to rank even higher.\n\nSecond is OpenSEO.\n\nIt's a free alternative to Ahrefs and Semrush.\n\nIt handles your keyword research, rank tracking, backlinks, and full site audits.\n\nAnd finally GEO Optimizer Skill.\n\nIt optimizes your website for the new Generative Engine Optimization standards.\n\nSo ChatGPT, Claude, and Google's AI Overviews directly cite your site instead of your competitors.\n\nThink of it like having an SEO agency living inside your terminal, one that never sleeps and never sends you an invoice.\n\nMost people are still optimizing purely for Google search rankings.\n\nBut the real shift right now is making sure AI tools recommend you directly.\n\n#openseo #searchengineoptimization #generativeengineoptimization #aiseo #claudecode ", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1789660838, "like_count": 3848, "comment_count": 6803, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1068742979393562a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 65.039, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-5.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPBQvPUQ-CIxoWDWqLgb52Q3c2Dx5YVsM9eM5IYJEhoDFqQ1KaHz0jZBje8Vdoc4E2_lZWsZth3c7C4we_9vE2ud5-yZkbxrZeN0H4.mp4?_nc_cat=107&_nc_oc=Ado2Hf_EWKTp58t7_bhvXXfPtgXbazTROu2VhM1fj34ARqCsCeXH416Rc-HR8pzkUFk&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-5.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=N8PgOvp5YjkQ7kNvwFG